                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Great to visit Eaton Rapids Medical Center and see firsthand the incredible work their staff does for our community. Quality health care close to home is essential, and I\u2019m committed to ensuring rural hospitals have the support they need to deliver. https://t.co/Cq8q7InIos",
