                "text": "Yesterday, I was honored to join @SecVetAffairs Collins for visits to the Battle Creek and Ann Arbor VA hospitals where we met with leadership and staff working hard every day to care for our veterans. Their commitment to supporting the VA mission is critical to making our medical centers the world-class facilities our veterans deserve.",
